    "sections": {
        "description": "The Italian House Restaurant theme is a modern, elegant, and responsive solution designed for Italian restaurants, pizzerias, cafes, bistros, fine dining, casual dining, catering services, food delivery services, coffee shops, culinary businesses, and hospitality ventures. Perfect for showcasing menus, signature dishes, chef profiles, reservations, events, online ordering, and special promotions, the theme offers a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for galleries, banners, testimonials, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, and interactive elements to engage visitors effectively. Built with clean and optimized code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to match your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for online orders and payments, Contact Form 7 for bookings and inquiries, and Jetpack for enhanced performance and security, the Italian House Restaurant theme provides a professional, SEO-friendly, and high-performing platform to elevate your Italian culinary business online."
    },
